plugin-net.wifi-summary = Wi-Fi hardware address and remembered open networks.
wifi-mac-title = Wi-Fi uses the real hardware address on every network
wifi-mac-summary = NetworkManager keeps the card's real address when it connects (cloned-mac-address is { $value }), so every network you join can recognise this computer.
wifi-open-title = An open Wi-Fi network is remembered
wifi-open-summary = The saved network { $name } has no password, so this computer joins it again by itself and anyone nearby can imitate it.
wifi-may-affect-captive = Networks that remember a device by its address (hotel and airport sign-in pages, address filters) will treat this computer as new on each network.
wifi-may-affect-filters = Home routers that allow only known addresses will refuse it until you allow the new one.
